        </h2>
        <p class="text-muted">
          Welcome to AT's Unblocked Games, your go-to destination for a curated selection of games that you can play anytime, anywhere. The entire site was developed by <a href="https://atproducts.xyz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AT Products LLC</a>. Whether you're looking for a quick puzzle to solve, an exciting arcade classic, or a casual game to pass the time, we've got you covered. Our collection is organized into easy-to-navigate categories, making it simple to find your next favorite game. All games are compatible with HTML5, Ruffle (for Flash games), and Emulator.js (for console games), ensuring a smooth gaming experience across various devices and platforms. Dive in and start playing today!
        </p>
