      <div class="text-center mx-md-5 mt-5">
        <h2 class="fs-2 fw-bold mb-3">
          <i class="bi bi-gear-fill me-2"></i> Compatibility w/ Technologies
        </h2>
        <p class="text-muted">
          Our games leverage modern web technologies to ensure broad compatibility and an enjoyable gaming experience. HTML5 powers most of our games, providing seamless playability across all major browsers without the need for additional plugins. For classic Flash games, we utilize <a href="https://ruffle.rs/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ruffle</a>, an open-source Flash Player emulator that allows you to enjoy these games safely and efficiently. 
